RealCandleBot

This project provides a real-time candle prediction system for mobile use with Quotex / Pocket Option charts. It contains:

FastAPI server (signal generation, WebSocket for live signals)

Simple rule-based predictor (EMA + RSI heuristics) in predictor.py

Telegram notifier (telegram_bot.py)

Browser userscript (userscript.js) to scrape OHLC from chart DOM and send to server

Minimal mobile web UI (index.html) to view signals


Important safety & legal notes:

This code does NOT interact with user accounts or place trades automatically.

Scraping or automating interactions with trading platforms may violate their Terms of Service. Use at your own risk.

No guarantee of profit. Use small amounts and test extensively on demo accounts.


How it works (high-level):

1. userscript running in your mobile browser reads the latest closed candle OHLC and sends it to server via POST /ingest.


2. The server appends the candle to a local stream and runs predictor to decide next candle: BULL/BEAR/NEUTRAL.


3. Server broadcasts result to connected clients via WebSocket and optionally sends Telegram alerts.


4. Mobile UI or Telegram receives signals in near real-time.



Quick start (local/dev):

1. Install Python 3.11+ and pip.


2. pip install -r requirements.txt


3. Run: uvicorn server:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000


4. Expose to internet for mobile using ngrok (or use VPS): ngrok http 8000


5. Install userscript in Tampermonkey (or similar) in your mobile browser and set SERVER_URL to your ngrok URL.



